- action(n7, "end of process"): Hallucinates an extra action step; the source text states "Finally, the process ends," which should be modeled directly by terminating at `end(e1)` after `action(n6, "...")`, not as a separate activity node.
- actor(a_default, "Default", [i1, n1, n2, n3, n4, n5, n6, n7, e1]): Violates SMC7 by assigning a generic "Default" participant instead of correctly mapping all nodes to "the doctor," who is explicitly responsible for every step in the source description.